     "title": "The Court's ledger",
     "clue": "court_ledger",
     "text": "GUESTS BELOW\nJune 2 - R. Okafor (from the Bowery). Kept.\nJune 19 - the Delgado girl. Kept.\nJuly 1 - H. Marsh, nightwatchman. Fed.\nJuly 7 - A. KESSLER, with the box. To be kept until Miss M. has opened it.\n\nThe box will not open for us. It opens for the one who carries it.\nKeep him alive."
